# 🇨🇦 British Columbia — The Ultimate Travel Guide

## Welcome to British Columbia

British Columbia is Canada's gateway to the Pacific, a province where ocean meets mountains, ancient forests meet modern cities, and adventure exists in every direction.

From the wild coastline of Vancouver Island to the towering peaks of the Rocky Mountains, British Columbia is one of the most diverse destinations on Earth. Travelers can explore rainforest trails in the morning, swim in a warm lake in the afternoon, and watch the sunset over the mountains in the evening.

BC is a destination built around nature, freedom, exploration, and unforgettable experiences.

