# Why British Columbia Is Special

British Columbia is unique because it combines many different worlds into one province.

A traveler can experience:

* A modern city adventure in Vancouver
* A peaceful island escape in Victoria or Tofino
* A mountain adventure in Whistler
* A wine vacation in the Okanagan
* A wilderness expedition in Northern BC
* A luxury resort experience
* A budget-friendly backpacking journey

Few places offer this much variety.

